# Normalise line endings so the repo is byte-identical on every machine.
#
# Without this, cloning on Windows rewrites every file to CRLF while the
# same clone on Linux/macOS gets LF — which produces phantom whole-file
# diffs and noisy "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings on every commit.
#
# LF everywhere is the right default here: the backend runs in a Linux
# container, and every modern Windows editor handles LF without complaint.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these if any get added later.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
